    "description": "<p>UNLIVING-GHOST</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Level 6</p>\n<p>You blur into gloom, smoke and half-seen reflections like a memory refusing to settle.</p>\n<p>You gain a +2 racial bonus to Stealth checks. While in dim light, darkness, mist, smoke, or supernatural gloom, you are concealed unless an observer can clearly perceive incorporeal creatures.</p>\n<p>Works automatically: +2 racial Stealth. Being concealed in dim light, darkness, mist, smoke or supernatural gloom is the table's.</p>",
